OL,3,GNEWSARestored WW2 cinema memorial to
OL,4,A'ordinary lives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe restoration of a cinema bombed in
OL,7,Fthe Hull Blitz will offer an insight
OL,8,Finto the experiences of ordinary
OL,9,Fcivilians at the time, campaigners
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe National Picture Theatre, which was
OL,13,Fhit during a German air raid on 18
OL,14,FMarch 1941 and left derelict, is to
OL,15,Freopen as a memorial garden and history
OL,16,Fcentre on Wednesday following a
OL,17,Frestoration project.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
