OL,3,GNEWSARestored WW2 cinema memorial to
OL,4,A'ordinary lives'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHilary Byers, a trustee of the National
OL,7,FCivilian World War II Memorial Trust,
OL,8,Fsaid the building was now a lasting
OL,9,Freminder of the resilience of people
OL,10,Fwho went about their daily lives as
OL,11,Fbombs fell around them.
OL,13,FThe restored building will be used for
OL,14,Forganised historical events,
OL,15,Feducational visits and other public
OL,16,Factivities.
